# Cron runtime state: the daily lead-report job writes its watermark and
# phone-enrichment cache next to the scripts in supabase/tools/. The cache
# holds real lead phone numbers (PII) and must never be committed.
# Only these two files are ignored; the rest of supabase/ is versioned.
.lead_report_watermark.json
.enrich_cache.json

